            "content": "High-Level Summary Technical Assistance Report\nFiscal Affairs Department",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.114,
                0.422,
                0.883,
                0.468
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "Implementing a Medium-Term Expenditure Framework\nPrepared by Virginia Alonso Albarran, Laura Doherty, Severin Kamgna, Youngwook Koh, Clemens Mungenast",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.112,
                0.494,
                0.861,
                0.54
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "The High-Level Summary Technical Assistance Report series provides high-level summaries of the assistance provided to IMF capacity development recipients, describing the high-level objectives, findings, and recommendations.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.112,
                0.552,
                0.88,
                0.701
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "ABSTRACT: This technical assistance provided guidance to implement a Medium-Term Expenditure Framework (MTEF) in Malaysia anchored in the 2023 Public Finance and Fiscal Responsibility Act, which represented progress in establishing fiscal rules supported by a medium-term fiscal perspective. Key challenges for integrating medium-term budgeting include publication of year-by-year fiscal projections to guide multi-year expenditure ceilings preparation, preparing multi-year baseline estimates, budget fragmentation, and improving coordination. The report recommends a phased MTEF rollout, with pilot ministries, strengthening the Medium-Term Fiscal Framework (MTFF), upgrading public financial management systems, and introducing a strategic budget phase supported by enhanced institutional arrangements. These reforms target fiscal discipline under the fiscal rules' framework, transparency, and public expenditure efficiency.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.12,
                0.711,
                0.84,
                0.784
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "JEL Classification Numbers H61, H68, H83, E62 (consult https://www.aeaweb.org/econlit/jelCodes.php)\nKeywords: Medium-Term Expenditure Framework (MTEF); Medium-Term Fiscal Framework (MTFF); Medium-Term Budget Framework (MTBF); Budget; Fiscal Rules; Fiscal Sustainability; Public Financial Management (PFM); Expenditure Ceilings; Budget Reform; Fiscal Strategy Statement; public finance; Malaysia",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
